# Complex Translator

An advanced sequence-to-sequence neural machine translation module built in PyTorch.

## Installation
```bash
pip install complex_translator
```

## Quick Start
```python
from complex_translator import MultilingualTokenizer
tokenizer = MultilingualTokenizer()
```
